{"seq":1,"slug":"tree-sitter-architecture","title":"Tree-sitter 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/tree-sitter-architecture","wordCount":1173,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"tree-sitter-架构\">Tree-sitter 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Tree-sitter 是为<strong>编辑器场景</strong>量身定制的解析器，它和编译器用的解析器有着根本不同的目标：编译器追求「正确解析完整程序」，Tree-sitter 追求「在用户敲字的每一刻都给出可用的近似树」。这一目标差异衍生出四个关键设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增量解析</td>\n<td>编辑后只重解析受影响部分（毫秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CST 表示</td>\n<td>保留标点注释等全部细节，供编辑器使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>代码不完整时仍能产出有用的树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S 表达式查询</td>\n<td>用模式匹配从树中提取高亮、折叠等信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解 Tree-sitter 的主线是：<strong>一切设计都服务于「用户代码永远处于半成品状态」这个现实</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量-glr-解析器\">增量 GLR 解析器</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的核心创新在于增量解析——当用户编辑代码时，解析器不需要重新解析整个文件，只需更新受影响的语法树部分。这使得即使在百万行的文件中，解析也能在毫秒级完成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Parser {&#10;  setLanguage(language: Language): void;&#10;  parse(input: string | Input, oldTree?: Tree): Tree;&#10;  reset(): void;&#10;  getLanguage(): Language;&#10;  setTimeoutMicros(timeout: number): void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Input {&#10;  (index: number, position: Point): string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Point {&#10;  row: number;&#10;  column: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">oldTree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setTimeoutMicros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 首次解析&#10;        SRC1[源代码] --&gt; PARSER1[GLR 解析器]&#10;        PARSER1 --&gt; TREE1[完整语法树]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 增量解析&#10;        EDIT[编辑操作] --&gt; TREE1&#10;        TREE1 --&gt; MARK[标记受影响节点]&#10;        MARK --&gt; PARSER2[增量 GLR 解析]&#10;        SRC2[修改后的源码] --&gt; PARSER2&#10;        PARSER2 --&gt; TREE2[更新后的语法树]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 首次解析\n        SRC1[源代码] --&gt; PARSER1[GLR 解析器]\n        PARSER1 --&gt; TREE1[完整语法树]\n    end\n    subgraph 增量解析\n        EDIT[编辑操作] --&gt; TREE1\n        TREE1 --&gt; MARK[标记受影响节点]\n        MARK --&gt; PARSER2[增量 GLR 解析]\n        SRC2[修改后的源码] --&gt; PARSER2\n        PARSER2 --&gt; TREE2[更新后的语法树]\n    end</pre><p>增量解析的关键步骤：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编辑通知</td>\n<td>调用 <code>tree.edit()</code> 告知语法树编辑位置和内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效标记</td>\n<td>解析器标记受编辑影响的节点为&quot;脏&quot;节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量重解析</td>\n<td>仅重新解析脏节点及其受影响的祖先节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树复用</td>\n<td>未受影响的节点直接从旧树复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> GLR（Generalized LR）解析算法可以处理有歧义的语法，它维护多个并行的解析状态，在遇到歧义时同时探索所有可能的分支。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cst-表示\">CST 表示</h2><p>Tree-sitter 生成具体语法树（Concrete Syntax Tree），与 AST 不同，CST 保留了源代码的所有语法细节，包括注释、空白和标点符号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SyntaxNode {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  startPosition: Point;&#10;  endPosition: Point;&#10;  startIndex: number;&#10;  endIndex: number;&#10;  parent: SyntaxNode | null;&#10;  children: SyntaxNode[];&#10;  namedChildren: SyntaxNode[];&#10;  childCount: number;&#10;  namedChildCount: number;&#10;  isNamed: boolean;&#10;  isMissing: boolean;&#10;  hasError: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startPosition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endPosition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedChildren</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  childCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedChildCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isNamed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isMissing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hasError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PROGRAM[program] --&gt; FN[function_declaration]&#10;    FN --&gt; NAME[&quot;identifier: &#39;add&#39;&quot;]&#10;    FN --&gt; PARAMS[formal_parameters]&#10;    PARAMS --&gt; LPAREN[&quot;&#39;(&#39;&quot;]&#10;    PARAMS --&gt; P1[&quot;identifier: &#39;a&#39;&quot;]&#10;    PARAMS --&gt; COMMA[&quot;&#39;,&#39;&quot;]&#10;    PARAMS --&gt; P2[&quot;identifier: &#39;b&#39;&quot;]&#10;    PARAMS --&gt; RPAREN[&quot;&#39;)&#39;&quot;]&#10;    FN --&gt; BODY[statement_block]&#10;    BODY --&gt; LBRACE[&quot;&#39;{&#39;&quot;]&#10;    BODY --&gt; RET[return_statement]&#10;    RET --&gt; RETURN[&quot;&#39;return&#39;&quot;]&#10;    RET --&gt; BINARY[binary_expression]&#10;    BINARY --&gt; A[&quot;identifier: &#39;a&#39;&quot;]&#10;    BINARY --&gt; PLUS[&quot;&#39;+&#39;&quot;]&#10;    BINARY --&gt; B[&quot;identifier: &#39;b&#39;&quot;]&#10;    BODY --&gt; RBRACE[&quot;&#39;}&#39;&quot;]\">graph TD\n    PROGRAM[program] --&gt; FN[function_declaration]\n    FN --&gt; NAME[\"identifier: 'add'\"]\n    FN --&gt; PARAMS[formal_parameters]\n    PARAMS --&gt; LPAREN[\"'('\"]\n    PARAMS --&gt; P1[\"identifier: 'a'\"]\n    PARAMS --&gt; COMMA[\"','\"]\n    PARAMS --&gt; P2[\"identifier: 'b'\"]\n    PARAMS --&gt; RPAREN[\"')'\"]\n    FN --&gt; BODY[statement_block]\n    BODY --&gt; LBRACE[\"'{'\"]\n    BODY --&gt; RET[return_statement]\n    RET --&gt; RETURN[\"'return'\"]\n    RET --&gt; BINARY[binary_expression]\n    BINARY --&gt; A[\"identifier: 'a'\"]\n    BINARY --&gt; PLUS[\"'+'\"]\n    BINARY --&gt; B[\"identifier: 'b'\"]\n    BODY --&gt; RBRACE[\"'}'\"]</pre><p>CST vs AST：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>CST (Tree-sitter)</th>\n<th>AST</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标点符号</td>\n<td>保留（如括号、逗号）</td>\n<td>省略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注释</td>\n<td>作为节点保留</td>\n<td>通常丢弃或单独存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空白</td>\n<td>通过位置信息隐式保留</td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名节点</td>\n<td>isNamed 区分语义节点和标点</td>\n<td>全部为语义节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>hasError 标记错误区域</td>\n<td>通常解析失败则无树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要用途</td>\n<td>编辑器功能（高亮、折叠）</td>\n<td>编译器分析、代码生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"树查询-s-表达式模式\">树查询（S 表达式模式）</h2><p>Tree-sitter 提供了强大的查询语言，使用 S 表达式模式匹配语法树中的节点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Query {&#10;  captureNames: string[];&#10;  matchLimit: number;&#10;  matches(node: SyntaxNode, options?: QueryOptions): QueryMatch[];&#10;  captures(node: SyntaxNode, options?: QueryOptions): QueryCapture[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QueryMatch {&#10;  pattern: number;&#10;  captures: QueryCapture[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QueryCapture {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  node: SyntaxNode;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  captureNames</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  matchLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  matches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryMatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  captures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryCapture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryMatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  captures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryCapture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryCapture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询语法示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; 匹配函数声明并捕获函数名&#10;(function_declaration&#10;  name: (identifier) @function.name&#10;  body: (statement_block) @function.body)&#10;&#10;; 匹配所有字符串字面量&#10;(string) @string&#10;&#10;; 匹配方法调用&#10;(call_expression&#10;  function: (member_expression&#10;    object: (identifier) @object&#10;    property: (property_identifier) @method))&#10;&#10;; 匹配 if-else 语句&#10;(if_statement&#10;  condition: (_) @condition&#10;  consequence: (_) @then&#10;  alternative: (_)? @else)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; 匹配函数声明并捕获函数名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: (identifier) @function.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (statement_block) @function.body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 匹配所有字符串字面量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(string) @string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 匹配方法调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(call_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function: (member_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    object: (identifier) @object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    property: (property_identifier) @method))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 匹配 if-else 语句</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(if_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  condition: (_) @condition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  consequence: (_) @then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  alternative: (_)? @else)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询谓词：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谓词</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>#eq?</code></td>\n<td><code>(#eq? @name &quot;value&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>节点文本等于指定值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#not-eq?</code></td>\n<td><code>(#not-eq? @name &quot;value&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>节点文本不等于指定值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#match?</code></td>\n<td><code>(#match? @name &quot;pattern&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>节点文本匹配正则表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#not-match?</code></td>\n<td><code>(#not-match? @name &quot;pat&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>节点文本不匹配正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#any-of?</code></td>\n<td><code>(#any-of? @name &quot;a&quot; &quot;b&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>节点文本为给定值之一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Tree-sitter 查询的性能非常好，因为它在编译查询时就优化了匹配路径。单个查询可以包含多个模式，一次遍历即可完成所有匹配。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"语言绑定\">语言绑定</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的核心是 C 语言库，但提供了多种语言的绑定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Parser from &#39;tree-sitter&#39;;&#10;import TypeScript from &#39;tree-sitter-typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;const parser = new Parser();&#10;parser.setLanguage(TypeScript.typescript);&#10;const tree = parser.parse(&#39;function greet(name: string): string { return &quot;Hello, &quot; + name; }&#39;);&#10;console.log(tree.rootNode.toString());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tree-sitter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeScript </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tree-sitter-typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TypeScript.typescript);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function greet(name: string): string { return \"Hello, \" + name; }'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tree.rootNode.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tree_sitter::{Parser, Language};&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; { fn tree_sitter_typescript() -&gt; Language; }&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let mut parser = Parser::new();&#10;    parser.set_language(unsafe { tree_sitter_typescript() }).unwrap();&#10;    let tree = parser.parse(&quot;function greet() { return &#39;hello&#39;; }&quot;, None).unwrap();&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, tree.root_node().to_sexp());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tree_sitter::{Parser, Language};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" { fn tree_sitter_typescript() -> Language; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut parser = Parser::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    parser.set_language(unsafe { tree_sitter_typescript() }).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let tree = parser.parse(\"function greet() { return 'hello'; }\", None).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", tree.root_node().to_sexp());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>绑定</th>\n<th>包名</th>\n<th>运行环境</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>tree-sitter (core)</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>编辑器核心、性能关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>tree-sitter (npm)</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>工具链、CLI、服务端分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>tree-sitter (crate)</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>编辑器（Helix、Zed）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASM</td>\n<td>web-tree-sitter</td>\n<td>浏览器/Node.js</td>\n<td>Web IDE、在线工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>tree-sitter (pip)</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>代码分析脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>go-tree-sitter</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>代码工具、lint 工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误恢复\">错误恢复</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的一个核心特性是强大的错误恢复能力。即使源代码包含语法错误，解析器仍能生成有用的语法树。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const incompleteCode = `&#10;function greet(name: string) {&#10;  if (name) {&#10;    console.log(&quot;Hello, &quot; + name)&#10;&#10;}&#10;`;&#10;&#10;const tree = parser.parse(incompleteCode);&#10;const root = tree.rootNode;&#10;&#10;function findErrors(node: SyntaxNode): void {&#10;  if (node.hasError) {&#10;    if (node.isMissing) {&#10;      console.log(`Missing: ${node.type} at ${node.startPosition.row}:${node.startPosition.column}`);&#10;    } else if (node.type === &#39;ERROR&#39;) {&#10;      console.log(`Error: unexpected content at ${node.startPosition.row}:${node.startPosition.column}`);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  for (const child of node.children) {&#10;    findErrors(child);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> incompleteCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">function greet(name: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  if (name) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    console.log(\"Hello, \" + name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(incompleteCode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tree.rootNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyntaxNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.hasError) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.isMissing) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Missing: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} at ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startPosition</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">row</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startPosition</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">column</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Error: unexpected content at ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startPosition</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">row</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startPosition</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">column</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.children) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    findErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SRC[&quot;不完整的源代码&quot;] --&gt; PARSER[解析器]&#10;    PARSER --&gt; TREE[&quot;语法树(含错误节点)&quot;]&#10;    TREE --&gt; OK[&quot;正确解析的节点&quot;]&#10;    TREE --&gt; ERR[&quot;ERROR 节点&quot;]&#10;    TREE --&gt; MISS[&quot;MISSING 节点&quot;]&#10;&#10;    OK --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[正常语法高亮]&#10;    ERR --&gt; RED[红色标记错误区域]&#10;    MISS --&gt; INSERT[推断缺失的语法元素]\">graph TD\n    SRC[\"不完整的源代码\"] --&gt; PARSER[解析器]\n    PARSER --&gt; TREE[\"语法树(含错误节点)\"]\n    TREE --&gt; OK[\"正确解析的节点\"]\n    TREE --&gt; ERR[\"ERROR 节点\"]\n    TREE --&gt; MISS[\"MISSING 节点\"]\n\n    OK --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[正常语法高亮]\n    ERR --&gt; RED[红色标记错误区域]\n    MISS --&gt; INSERT[推断缺失的语法元素]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点状态</th>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>hasError=false</td>\n<td>解析成功的有效节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n<td>type=&quot;ERROR&quot;</td>\n<td>解析器无法理解的内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MISSING</td>\n<td>isMissing=true</td>\n<td>解析器推断缺失的语法元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含错误子树</td>\n<td>hasError=true</td>\n<td>节点本身可能正确但子树有错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 错误恢复是编辑器场景的核心需求——用户在编辑过程中代码几乎总是处于&quot;不完整&quot;状态。Tree-sitter 在错误节点周围仍能提供准确的语法高亮和代码折叠。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Tree-sitter 架构))&#10;    增量解析&#10;      GLR 算法&#10;      编辑通知 tree.edit&#10;      脏节点标记与复用&#10;      毫秒级更新&#10;    CST 表示&#10;      保留所有语法细节&#10;      命名节点 vs 匿名节点&#10;      isNamed / hasError&#10;    树查询&#10;      S 表达式模式&#10;      捕获 @name&#10;      谓词过滤&#10;      编译时优化&#10;    语言绑定&#10;      C 核心库&#10;      Node / Rust / WASM&#10;      Python / Go&#10;    错误恢复&#10;      ERROR 节点&#10;      MISSING 推断&#10;      不完整代码仍可解析\">mindmap\n  root((Tree-sitter 架构))\n    增量解析\n      GLR 算法\n      编辑通知 tree.edit\n      脏节点标记与复用\n      毫秒级更新\n    CST 表示\n      保留所有语法细节\n      命名节点 vs 匿名节点\n      isNamed / hasError\n    树查询\n      S 表达式模式\n      捕获 @name\n      谓词过滤\n      编译时优化\n    语言绑定\n      C 核心库\n      Node / Rust / WASM\n      Python / Go\n    错误恢复\n      ERROR 节点\n      MISSING 推断\n      不完整代码仍可解析</pre><ul>\n<li>Tree-sitter 是<strong>增量 GLR 解析器</strong>，编辑后仅重新解析受影响的节点，实现毫秒级更新。</li>\n<li>生成 <strong>CST（具体语法树）</strong>，保留标点、注释等所有语法细节，通过 <code>isNamed</code> 区分语义节点。</li>\n<li><strong>S 表达式查询语言</strong>支持模式匹配和捕获，配合谓词实现精确的节点过滤。</li>\n<li>核心库为 C 语言实现，提供 <strong>Node.js/Rust/WASM/Python/Go</strong> 等多语言绑定。</li>\n<li><strong>错误恢复</strong>能力确保不完整代码仍能生成有用的语法树，这是编辑器场景的核心需求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tree-sitter 架构","id":"tree-sitter-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"增量 GLR 解析器","id":"增量-glr-解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"CST 表示","id":"cst-表示"},{"level":2,"text":"树查询（S 表达式模式）","id":"树查询-s-表达式模式"},{"level":2,"text":"语言绑定","id":"语言绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"错误恢复","id":"错误恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高级调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/advanced-debugging"},"next":{"title":"语法开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/grammar-development"}}